1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,181
How was your first day?

2
00:00:09,855 --> 00:00:10,855
It was fun.

3
00:00:11,332 --> 00:00:13,599
Didn't expect to see team lead here.

4
00:00:14,637 --> 00:00:15,779
Outside the office,

5
00:00:15,779 --> 00:00:17,133
just call me casually.

6
00:00:18,796 --> 00:00:19,796
Ok

7
00:00:32,865 --> 00:00:33,865
Unnie

8
00:00:34,387 --> 00:00:36,000
Can I ask you something?

9
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,117
Have you ever...

10
00:00:40,817 --> 00:00:41,920
slept with someone

11
00:00:42,522 --> 00:00:44,209
the first time you met them?

12
00:00:47,652 --> 00:00:48,822
Do I seem like the type?

13
00:00:53,082 --> 00:00:54,433
It was my first time.

14
00:00:55,403 --> 00:00:57,403
Sleeping with someone I just met.

15
00:00:57,896 --> 00:00:59,562
At my place, too!

16
00:01:02,049 --> 00:01:03,543
Lower your voice.

17
00:01:05,186 --> 00:01:07,186
You're so easy to read
when you're flustered.

18
00:01:08,446 --> 00:01:09,446
Cute.

19
00:01:21,005 --> 00:01:22,005
But unnie.

20
00:01:22,682 --> 00:01:23,432
How did you

21
00:01:23,432 --> 00:01:25,135
become team lead already?

22
00:01:26,150 --> 00:01:27,406
My mom's the CEO.

23
00:01:30,476 --> 00:01:32,533
So you joined the company
right after graduation?

24
00:01:32,533 --> 00:01:33,144
Nope.

25
00:01:33,324 --> 00:01:35,076
It's been less than a year.

26
00:01:35,404 --> 00:01:36,404
Really?

27
00:01:36,552 --> 00:01:37,655
Then what did you do

28
00:01:37,655 --> 00:01:38,655
before this?

29
00:01:39,415 --> 00:01:41,072
I had my own brand.

30
00:01:41,484 --> 00:01:42,673
Cool.

31
00:01:43,851 --> 00:01:44,851
But

32
00:01:45,333 --> 00:01:46,494
It didn't go well.

33
00:01:49,327 --> 00:01:51,365
I was kind of lost for a while.

34
00:01:51,616 --> 00:01:53,616
My mom pulled me

35
00:01:53,844 --> 00:01:55,434
in for a new brand.

36
00:01:56,166 --> 00:01:57,508
She wanted me to lead it.

37
00:01:58,856 --> 00:02:00,722
So I joined the company

38
00:02:01,693 --> 00:02:02,892
but honestly,

39
00:02:03,682 --> 00:02:04,900
It's scary.

40
00:02:07,939 --> 00:02:08,939
Why?

41
00:02:11,621 --> 00:02:13,621
Because if I mess up this time,

42
00:02:15,957 --> 00:02:16,746
I'm not the only one

43
00:02:16,746 --> 00:02:18,512
who'll get hurt.

44
00:02:23,519 --> 00:02:25,214
That got too deep, didn't it?

45
00:02:26,812 --> 00:02:27,812
Sorry

46
00:02:31,176 --> 00:02:32,176
Unnie

47
00:02:32,463 --> 00:02:33,709
Don't worry too much.

48
00:02:33,942 --> 00:02:35,627
It's going to work out.

49
00:02:36,864 --> 00:02:38,072
I'll do my best help you.

50
00:02:41,271 --> 00:02:42,271
Thank you.
